243b38d996bb, https://si.imgix.net/b7de5da2/uploads/origins/c4902712-a15b-43f7-ab61-30d07e09cbbc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c6c7a181f5237258dbd3047ea9b5b02 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b7de5da2/uploads/origins/c4902712-a15b-43f7-ab61-30d07e09cbbc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bdb8fee69d7465b794d731142fa1d9fb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I was hoping to get two pictures of my moth boy Dew\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/tIxvxbo\n\nFor the subject matter of the first picture, I was hoping for him to be slightly a bit chubby, with his lower pair of arms gripping his small yet pudgy belly while one of his upper pair of arms is holding a snack with his facial expression maybe a bit concerned with him wondering if he's putting on weight\n\nAs for the second picture, I would like him significantly fatter and sitting down as he is surrounded by a bunch of empty honey jars, his mouth and cheeks covered in globs of honey, his expression having him be in a bit of a lethargic daze after eating so much\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/tIxvxbo", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Chibanyann/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/193670a9/uploads/origins/74498aaf-f63f-4a6d-9780-f1827bff9992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c1e29637075d90c7f35245f61b308b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/193670a9/uploads/origins/74498aaf-f63f-4a6d-9780-f1827bff9992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c1e29637075d90c7f35245f61b308b5, https://si.imgix.net/193670a9/uploads/origins/74498aaf-f63f-4a6d-9780-f1827bff9992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e32e65ebf97bd29905ab97bc6d1af284 2x, https://si.imgix.net/193670a9/uploads/origins/74498aaf-f63f-4a6d-9780-f1827bff9992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=20